{
  "id": "JDG.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Judges 7",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One day Gideon and all his men got up early and camped beside the Spring of Harod. The Midianite camp was in the valley to the north of them by Moreh Hill.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Gideon, “The men you have are too many for me to give them victory over the Midianites. They might think that they had won by themselves, and so give me no credit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.20.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 20.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Announce to the people, ‘Anyone who is afraid should go back home, and we will stay here at Mount Gilead.’ ” So 22,000 went back, but 10,000 stayed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Gideon, “You still have too many men. Take them down to the water, and I will separate them for you there. If I tell you a man should go with you, he will go. If I tell you a man should not go with you, he will not go.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideon took the men down to the water, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to him, “Separate everyone who laps up the water with his tongue like a dog, from everyone who gets down on his knees to drink.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There were 300 men who scooped up water in their hands and lapped it; all the others got down on their knees to drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Gideon, “I will rescue you and give you victory over the Midianites with the 300 men who lapped the water. Tell everyone else to go home.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Gideon sent all the Israelites home, except the 300, who kept all the supplies and trumpets. The Midianite camp was below them in the valley.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That night the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded Gideon, “Get up and attack the camp; I am giving you victory over it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if you are afraid to attack, go down to the camp with your servant Purah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will hear what they are saying, and then you will have the courage to attack.” So Gideon and his servant Purah went down to the edge of the enemy camp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Midianites, the Amalekites, and the desert tribesmen were spread out in the valley like a swarm of locusts, and they had as many camels as there were grains of sand on the seashore.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Gideon arrived, he heard a man telling a friend about a dream. He was saying, “I dreamt that a loaf of barley bread rolled into our camp and hit a tent. The tent collapsed and lay flat on the ground.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "His friend replied, “It's the sword of the Israelite, Gideon son of Joash! It can't mean anything else! God has given him victory over Midian and our whole army!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Gideon heard about the man's dream and what it meant, he fell to his knees and worshipped the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Then he went back to the Israelite camp and said, “Get up! The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is giving you victory over the Midianite army!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He divided his 300 men into three groups and gave each man a trumpet and a jar with a torch inside it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He told them, “When I get to the edge of the camp, watch me, and do what I do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When my group and I blow our trumpets, then you blow yours all round the camp and shout, ‘For the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and for Gideon!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gideon and his hundred men came to the edge of the camp a short while before midnight, just after the guard had been changed. Then they blew the trumpets and broke the jars they were holding, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the other two groups did the same. They all held the torches in their left hands, the trumpets in their right, and shouted, “A sword for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and for Gideon!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every man stood in his place round the camp, and the whole enemy army ran away yelling. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While Gideon's men were blowing their trumpets, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " made the enemy troops attack each other with their swords. They ran towards Zarethan as far as Beth Shittah, as far as the town of Abel Meholah near Tabbath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then men from the tribes of Naphtali, Asher, and both parts of Manasseh were called out, and they pursued the Midianites. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
